<div data-cgap-sector="Gas Distribution, Propane &amp; Pipelines" data-cgap-term="propane"></div><p class="lead">Gas utilities and propane dealers have two audiences: trained crews who need clear procedure reminders at the equipment, and the public, who need to know to stay back, not smoke and call before they dig.</p><p>These signs cover regulator and meter stations, propane bulk plants and bobtail loading, cylinder exchange cages, pipeline right of way, pig launchers and receivers, cathodic protection rectifiers, odorant and leak response, and LNG and compressor stations. They are 8x12 aluminum and stand up to sun and weather on a fence, cage or skid.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Regulator and meter stations</h3><p>Station fences, regulators, meters and filter separators. 205 signs. Typical spot: On meter set with utility lock.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-locked-gas-meter-sign-8x12-aluminum">Locked Gas Meter</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-gas-meter-test-hose-sign-cgap-w06633-812">Gas Meter Test Hose</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-gas-meter-bank-sign-cgap-c16629-812">Gas Meter Bank</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-gas-meter-seal-sign-cgap-n21433-812">Gas Meter Seal</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Propane bulk plants and loading</h3><p>Bulk tanks, bobtail racks and transfer areas. 106 signs. Typical spot: On new tanks at first fill.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-new-propane-tank-sign-8x12-aluminum">New Propane Tank</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-propane-transfer-hose-sign-cgap-w01835-812">Propane Transfer Hose</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-propane-tank-saddle-sign-cgap-c14359-812">Propane Tank Saddle</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-propane-transfer-pump-sign-cgap-n13354-812">Propane Transfer Pump</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Cylinder exchange and filling</h3><p>Exchange cages, filling stations and cylinder storage. 87 signs. Typical spot: At cylinder fill docks and job sites.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-propane-cylinders-sign-8x12-aluminum">Propane Cylinders</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cylinder-valve-sign-cgap-w14240-812">Cylinder Valve</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cage-bollards-sign-cgap-c21255-812">Cage Bollards</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-cylinder-scale-sign-cgap-n18537-812">Cylinder Scale</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pipeline right of way</h3><p>Markers and warnings for the public and for anyone digging. 151 signs. Typical spot: At excavation during cut-outs.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-pipeline-cut-out-sign-8x12-aluminum">Pipeline Cut-Out</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pipeline-cp-ac-supply-sign-cgap-w07440-812">Pipeline CP AC Supply</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-gas-main-marker-post-sign-cgap-c19693-812">Gas Main Marker Post</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-pipeline-purge-work-area-sign-cgap-n23048-812">Pipeline Purge Work Area</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pig launchers and receivers</h3><p>Closures, interlocks and pressure on launchers and receivers. 88 signs. Typical spot: At pig trap vent outlet.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-pig-trap-vent-sign-8x12-aluminum">Pig Trap Vent</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pig-trap-hinged-door-sign-cgap-w03434-812">Pig Trap Hinged Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pig-cart-path-sign-cgap-c11737-812">Pig Cart Path</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-pig-signaler-sign-cgap-n06552-812">Pig Signaler</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Cathodic protection</h3><p>Rectifiers, test stations and anode beds. 57 signs. Typical spot: On rectifier disconnect.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-cp-rectifier-disconnect-sign-8x12-aluminum">CP Rectifier Disconnect</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-anode-bed-junction-box-sign-cgap-w14214-812">Anode Bed Junction Box</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-rectifier-pad-sign-cgap-c21029-812">Rectifier Pad</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-rectifier-ac-breaker-sign-cgap-n23049-812">Rectifier AC Breaker</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Odorant and leak response</h3><p>Odorant equipment and what to do when someone smells gas. 115 signs. Typical spot: At barricade around leak site.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-gas-leak-area-sign-8x12-aluminum">Gas Leak Area</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-meter-leak-test-blank-sign-cgap-w10638-812">Meter Leak Test Blank</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-odorant-hose-rack-sign-cgap-c03794-812">Odorant Hose Rack</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-lng-flame-detector-sign-cgap-n14767-812">LNG Flame Detector</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>LNG and compressor stations</h3><p>Vaporizers, boil off compressors and cold piping. 212 signs. Typical spot: At sample valve.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-lng-sample-point-sign-8x12-aluminum">LNG Sample Point</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-compressor-fan-belt-sign-cgap-w01837-812">Compressor Fan Belt</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-vaporizer-fin-edges-sign-cgap-c15763-812">Vaporizer Fin Edges</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-lng-storage-tank-sign-cgap-n11737-812">LNG Storage Tank</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs does a propane bulk plant need?</summary><p>Typical postings cover no smoking or open flames, the transfer and loading area, the emergency shutoff location and who to call in an emergency. Search &quot;propane bulk plant&quot; to see the options by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for cylinder exchange cages?</summary><p>Yes, including signs for customers and staff at the cage, the bollards and the customer lane. Search &quot;cylinder exchange&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Can these mount on chain link or a station fence?</summary><p>Yes. The pre-drilled corners take zip ties, wire or bolts for fence panels, cages and skids.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs does a propane bulk plant need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings cover no smoking or open flames, the transfer and loading area, the emergency shutoff location and who to call in an emergency. Search \"propane bulk plant\" to see the options by install point."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for cylinder exchange cages?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including signs for customers and staff at the cage, the bollards and the customer lane. Search \"cylinder exchange\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can these mount on chain link or a station fence?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The pre-drilled corners take zip ties, wire or bolts for fence panels, cages and skids."}}]}</script>